the knowledge base obligation includes:

the text of the source program is at "sources/obligation-scasp.pl".

the_borrower has an obligation that the_borrower pays 550 to the_lender on 2015-06-01.

the_borrower has an obligation that the_borrower pays 525 to the_lender on 2016-06-01.

the_borrower defaults on a date if
    the_borrower has an obligation that a requirement
    and the_borrower fails to fulfil the obligation that the requirement
    and the_lender notifies the_borrower on a second date that the_borrower fails to fulfil the obligation that the requirement
    and the date is days after 2 with the second date
    and it is not the case that the_borrower cures the failure of on or before that the obligation with a day with the date with the requirement.

a borrower cures the failure of on or before that an obligation with a day with a date with a requirement if
    the borrower cures the failure of the obligation on the day that the requirement
    and the day is on or before the date.

the_borrower fails to fulfil an obligation that the_borrower pays an amount to the_lender on a date if
    it is not the case that the_borrower pays the amount to the_lender on the date.

the_borrower cures the failure of an obligation on a day that the_borrower pays an amount to the_lender on a date if
    the_borrower pays the amount to the_lender on the day.

a day is on or before a thing if
    the thing is days after a thing T with the day
    and T >= 0.

a date D is days after a thing T with a date N if
    D = T + N.

